    <items xsi:type="form:FormField">
      <name>DontShowAgain</name>
      <id>58</id>
      <title>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Do not show again, open print form at once</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>دوباره نمایش داده نشود، فرم چاپی بلافاصله باز شود</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Больше не показывать и открывать печатную форму сразу</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Yazdırma formu artık tek seferde gösterilmeyecek ve açılmayacak</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Không hiển thị nữa và mở ngay mẫu in</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Do not show again, open print form at once</value>
      </title>
      <title>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Do not show again, open print form at once</value>
      </title>
      <visible>true</visible>
      <enabled>true</enabled>
      <userVisible>
        <common>true</common>
      </userVisible>
      <dataPath xsi:type="form:DataPath">
        <segments>DontShowAgain</segments>
      </dataPath>
      <titleLocation>Right</titleLocation>
      <titleHeight>1</titleHeight>
      <toolTip>
        <key>en</key>
        <value>Print form is not opened when generating print forms. Office documents are opened at once.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>fa</key>
        <value>هنگام ایجاد فرم‌های چاپی، فرم چاپی باز نمی‌شود. اسناد آفیس بلافاصله باز می‌شوند.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>ru</key>
        <value>Форма печати больше не будет открываться при формировании печатных форм. Офисные документы будут открываться сразу. </value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>tr</key>
        <value>Yazdırılan formlar artık yazdırma formu olarak açılmayacak. Ofis belgeleri tek seferde açılacak.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>vi</key>
        <value>Biểu mẫu in sẽ không mở ra khi tạo mẫu in. Các chứng từ văn bản sẽ mở ra ngay.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>it</key>
        <value>Print form is not opened when generating print forms. Office documents are opened at once.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <toolTip>
        <key>pl</key>
        <value>Print form is not opened when generating print forms. Office documents are opened at once.</value>
      </toolTip>
      <handlers>
        <event>OnChange</event>
        <name>DontShowAgainOnChange</name>
      </handlers>
